<title>USA: Income opportunities to buyback up to 5pct.</title>
<headline>Income opportunities to buyback up to 5pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Income Opportunities Fund 1999 Inc said on Tuesday that up to five percent of its outstanding common can be bought under a continuing share repurchase program.</p>
<p>The shares cannot be bought for a price more than their market price on the New York Stock Exchange, the company said.</p>
</text>
